{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to Villainville!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations\u2013you\u2019ve made a deal with the devil. Or, close enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a bankrupt royal on the run from your kingdom\u2019s creditors--your grandpappy King Midas really did LOVE gold. With a whole new disguise and life on the island of Batwing, you\u2019ve ready to enjoy yourself. <br>But the villains of Batwing are desperate to leave the island as a plague of misery mushrooms spread. Can you forge the ragtag group of outcasts into a community, and stand up to the Godmothers? Because they've decided none of you deserve a happily ever after, but you're about to prove them wrong.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow magic crops, from ghost peppers, to pumpkins that ripen into jack-o-lanterns, and the blood bag tomatoes that are good enough to fool a vamp!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/e9a739dcebc9578be014540cd659619d.poster.avif?t=1769656665\" width=494 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/e9a739dcebc9578be014540cd659619d.webm?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/e9a739dcebc9578be014540cd659619d.mp4?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the island\u2019s underbelly to sleuth out the truth of who started the misery plague in this player-responsive story with mini mysteries and multiple outcomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise enchanting farm animals to restore the protective magic of the land\u2013including tiny darling but deadly unicorns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/31b22d6d0d79846efd236b7312a032ca.poster.avif?t=1769656665\" width=356 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/31b22d6d0d79846efd236b7312a032ca.webm?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/31b22d6d0d79846efd236b7312a032ca.mp4?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create an entirely new identity\u2013complete with tattoos and horns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/bfe7ab0836684f8095617334f275944f.poster.avif?t=1769656665\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/bfe7ab0836684f8095617334f275944f.webm?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/bfe7ab0836684f8095617334f275944f.mp4?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and befriend quirky creatures in habitats such as the island's graveyards, and strangely beautiful mines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast aside your rusty old weapons\u2013as a farmer, you\u2019ll search out tool treasures such as an epic axe that takes out an entire swath of trees with one throw</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the rich stories behind Batwing Island\u2019s 60+ upended fairytale NPCs to forge friendships, resolve fights, and create a community out of outlaws</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/b17a0b7d731fbff7460b8680f91442c4.poster.avif?t=1769656665\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/b17a0b7d731fbff7460b8680f91442c4.webm?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/b17a0b7d731fbff7460b8680f91442c4.mp4?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fascinating open world and dispel illusions to reveal secrets resources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/02dab5195ac29273b8bd19036ca65137.poster.avif?t=1769656665\" width=438 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/02dab5195ac29273b8bd19036ca65137.webm?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/02dab5195ac29273b8bd19036ca65137.mp4?t=1769656665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date and bond with the island\u2019s cuties, from a big bad wolf who is not what he seems to a washed up siren, or the numerous out-of-luck island heroes and royals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/4e5a3637bb335a061d9b58ba4d279341.avif?t=1769656665\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access the island\u2019s night market and meet your fellow creatures of the moon, with quests, NPCs, and shops for the nocturnal types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your heebie-jeebie meter in the face of your fears and save the island from the encroaching misery mushrooms and monsters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/extras/8776246ae1d50fb78236e5f551c6f48a.avif?t=1769656665\" width=312 height=420 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488670?t=1769656665","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488670?t=1769656665","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/c244ff7ac8c3ce9bece121837c98a82af0c14651/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769656665","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488670/c244ff7ac8c3ce9bece121837c98a82af0c14651/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769656665","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","